{
  "id": "DEU.29",
  "number": "29",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Kumbukumbu La Sheria 29",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "29",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "29",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haya ni maneno ya agano ambalo Mwenyezi-Mungu aliwaamuru Mose kufanya na Waisraeli katika nchi ya Moabu, licha ya agano Mwenyezi-Mungu alilofanya nao mlimani Horebu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose aliwaita pamoja Waisraeli wote akawaambia, “Mliona nyinyi wenyewe jinsi Mwenyezi-Mungu alivyomtendea mfalme wa Misri, maofisa, watumishi wake na nchi yake yote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mliona maafa makubwa, ishara na maajabu aliyotenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini mpaka leo Mwenyezi-Mungu hajawapa akili ya kuelewa, macho ya kuona, wala masikio ya kusikia!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwa muda wa miaka arubaini, mimi niliwaongoza jangwani, nguo zenu mlizovaa hazikuchakaa wala viatu vyenu havikuchakaa miguuni mwenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamkula mkate wala kunywa divai au kileo chochote kile, mpate kujua kwamba Mwenyezi-Mungu ni Mungu wenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Na mlipofika mahali hapa, mfalme Sihoni wa Heshboni na mfalme Ogu wa Bashani walikuja kupigana nasi; lakini tukawashinda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tukaichukua nchi yao, tukayagawia makabila ya Reubeni na Gadi na nusu kabila la Manase iwe mali yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo muwe waangalifu kushika maneno yote ya agano hili ili mpate kufanikiwa katika kazi zenu zote.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Leo, mmesimama mbele ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu, nyinyi nyote viongozi wa makabila, wazee wenu, maofisa wenu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "watoto wenu na wake zenu, wageni wanaoishi miongoni mwenu ambao hukata kuni na kuwatekea maji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mko hapa leo ili kufanya agano hili ambalo Bwana Mungu wenu anafanya leo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwamba atawathibitisha leo kuwa watu wake naye atakuwa Mungu wenu, kama alivyowaapia nyinyi na babu zenu: Abrahamu, Isaka na Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wala sifanyi agano hili leo kwa niaba yenu tu na kutamka laana zake; sifanyi kwa niaba ya wale tu walio pamoja nasi leo mbele ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wetu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bali pia kwa niaba ya wale ambao hawapo pamoja nasi leo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mnajua jinsi tulivyoishi nchini Misri na jinsi tulivyosafiri katika nchi za mataifa mengine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mliona sanamu zao za kuchukiza, miungu ya miti na mawe, ya fedha na dhahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chukueni hadhari kwamba hakuna mwanamume, mwanamke, jamaa au kabila lolote linalosimama hapa leo litakalomwacha Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wetu, kwenda kutumikia miungu ya mataifa mengine. Jambo hili litakuwa kama mzizi utakaomea na kuzaa matunda machungu yenye sumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kama baada ya kusikia maneno ya agano hili ambayo mmeapishwa, halafu mtu akajiamini mwenyewe moyoni mwake na kusema atakuwa salama, hata kama atafuata ukaidi wake mwenyewe, hiyo itawaangamiza wote, wabaya na wema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu hatasamehe mtu huyo, nayo hasira ya Mwenyezi-Mungu na wivu wake vitamwakia mtu huyo; laana zote zilizoandikwa katika kitabu hiki zitamjia, naye Mwenyezi-Mungu atalifuta kabisa jina la mtu huyo kutoka duniani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu atamtenga kutoka miongoni mwa makabila yote ya Israeli apatwe na maafa kufuatana na laana zote za agano zilizoandikwa katika kitabu hiki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katika vizazi vijavyo, wazawa wenu na wageni kutoka nchi ya mbali wataona jinsi Mwenyezi-Mungu alivyoiletea nchi hii maafa na mateso: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imejaa madini ya kiberiti na chumvi, imeteketea na kuwa tupu, haikupandwa mbegu na haioti chochote. Ni kama ilivyokuwa wakati Mwenyezi-Mungu alipoangamiza Sodoma na Gomora, Adma na Seboimu, kwa hasira yake kali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naam, mataifa yote yatasema: ‘Kwa nini Mwenyezi-Mungu ameitendea hivyo nchi hii? Hasira hii kubwa inamaanisha nini?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na jibu litatolewa: ‘Ni kwa sababu walivunja agano la Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wa wazee wao ambalo alifanya nao alipowatoa katika nchi ya Misri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakaenda kuitumikia na kuiabudu miungu mingine, ambayo hawakuijua hapo awali, wala Mwenyezi-Mungu hakuwa amewapa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo hasira ya Mwenyezi-Mungu iliwaka dhidi ya nchi hii, na kuiletea laana zote zilizoandikwa katika kitabu hiki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Mwenyezi-Mungu, akawangoa kutoka katika nchi yao kwa hasira na ghadhabu kubwa, akawatupa katika nchi nyingine kama ilivyo leo.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mambo ya siri ni ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wetu, lakini yale ambayo ameyafunua ni yetu na wazawa wetu milele, ili tutekeleze maneno yote ya sheria hii.”",
